{"id":"n31764-1-8","stage":2,"title":"정지 · 停止","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31764-1-8-1","ko":"왜 갑자기 기계가 정지가 됐나요?","zh":"为什么机器突然停止运转了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"기계가","meaning":"机械，机器","explanation":"기계：机械，机器；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기계","audio":"/audio/5eb260fa2e31046f6526.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62451","senseId":"1","lemma":"기계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기계가","audio":"/audio/9640ba96b1a91594b6fa.mp3"}},{"text":"정지가","meaning":"停止","explanation":"정지：停止；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"정지","audio":"/audio/7a39039ca2ca3a324765.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31764","senseId":"1","lemma":"정지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정지가","audio":"/audio/9d81285aa5b839fe03af.mp3"}},{"text":"됐나요?","meaning":"用完，没有","explanation":"되다：用完，没有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"15","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐나요","audio":"/audio/0d9995bf2cfc1caedcdc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑